{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_053820","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加基地那次，你们可真是“盛情款待”啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"……抱歉。但我无论如何都想知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"The Boss最后的行动？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":26,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯。我想通过输入她的思考和行动，让AI中寄宿她的精神。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"可是，只有她最后的行动我无法理解。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"你说的是“食蛇者行动”吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"官方说法是，她背叛祖国美国并叛逃，最后被你杀死。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……不可能。没有人比The Boss离“背叛”这种行为更遥远。这在逻辑上自相矛盾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"包含这种矛盾的AI无法正常启动……就像电影里的HAL发生故障一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"逻辑上我早就明白。可我需要佐证。The Boss最后的行动，她真正的意图。无论如何都要！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以你想从我这里问出来？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"没错。你的沉默，就是答案。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""}]}